 \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lyxeno\">lyxeno</a> 应该没有吧 我菲区 Astra Ultra 拉满 除了有点慢 没提示过模型超负荷 一般 TIBO 重置的时候 用 6.1sol 偶尔会提示</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224663\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/385553dc16572febdc4bef2cec8d6af4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"houOne\" data-uid=\"236494\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/houOne\">houOne</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 10:50:06 +08:00\">16h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>菲区 没有礼品卡， 国内的 v/m 卡都不能付</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18224874\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/576a8327af614198585548a11aa5dd6f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Test1Test\" data-uid=\"623924\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Test1Test\">Test1Test</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 11:15:38 +08:00\">16h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>申请个 maya ，可以申请菲律宾的银行卡，应该就能绑定了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225069\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/920521adc53ea7acdbe2970a91e96b79?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pandamen\" data-uid=\"582792\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pandamen\">pandamen</a></